{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24071","headline":"寒食 · 白居易","name":"寒食","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人老何所乐，乐在归乡国。\n我归故园来，九度逢寒食。\n故园在何处，池馆东城侧。\n四隣梨花时，二月伊水色。\n岂独好风土，仍多旧亲戚。\n出去恣欢游，归来聊燕息。\n有官供禄俸，无事劳心力。\n但恐优稳多，微躬销不得。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24071.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24071","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}